{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "32f8c239bb01cbac7f7217037afb4c3a25347cac2b116dc552164704f5bc4a71", "ja": "新興宗教の教祖＜モーガン＞、マフィアの\nボス＜イーサン＞、快楽殺人者＜ゼノビア＞\n寄せ集めのチームは、早々に別行動となる。\n街で情報を集めたスタークスはマフィアに\n狙いを定め、イーサンを尾行するが……。", "zh": "新兴宗教教主＜莫甘＞、黑手党首领＜伊桑＞、快乐杀人犯＜泽诺比亚＞\n这支临时拼凑的队伍很快便分头行动。\n在城里收集情报的斯塔克斯将目标锁定为黑手党，跟踪起伊桑来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "b92c1b0e4c82cfe2794dc845dcb9cc5f4843a52ccf791063b8cefc4533a5b06d", "ja": "流行ってないダイナーですね……。冴えない三流刑事が\nクダを巻くにはいかにもお似合いといった感じの……。", "zh": "真是不时髦的小餐馆啊……。倒是很适合让不得志的三流刑警借酒发牢骚……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "d4ef0972868b05f4bf35990beb4519191efb15eb6deeed3db0644d0f2d747947", "ja": "余計なお世話だ。というか、流行りの店で\n極秘任務の話をしろってのか？", "zh": "多管闲事。话说回来，你是想让我在时髦的店里谈秘密任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "edf81ed7716a11431288449fad8beb03ec9846f59a5c3d4d384818bb984372db", "ja": "まぁ、これくらいがちょうどいいんじゃない？\n料理は、なかなか美味しそうだしね。", "zh": "哎呀，这样不就刚刚好吗？\n而且饭菜看起来也挺好吃的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "2726fdc94685148211ddb1c1fc496d8d101347c361b375c2543fafde435c3168", "ja": "そんなことより仕事の話だ。ハーマンが見せた\n例の相関図だが、流石に細部の記憶が怪しい。", "zh": "比起那个，还是说说工作的事吧。哈曼展示的那张关系图，我对细节的记忆实在有些模糊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "2b7c8c1b6d4c70e79f0afc0e9ae8bea85791b4fc46868e566efedc482a7879d0", "ja": "……。\n待ってろ、書き出してやる。", "zh": "……。\n等着，我写出来给你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "dd0802c108ce88c9f637ebd466106be2c0d7fa8e155cd2723a961efdd5519b9b", "ja": "……っと、こんなもんか？　ほら。", "zh": "……嗯，这样就差不多了吧？给。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "c7dfe67888ced8f59bcf4e4118c9134d62e8ddc2e5b003791bc620122ec76cfa", "ja": "信じられないな、あの一瞬で……。\n僕が見た限りでは、記憶とまるで同じだ。", "zh": "真不敢相信，居然在那一瞬间……。\n至少在我看来，和记忆中的一模一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "460d768cbc15174b6518fd30c08180feb31bc354837e6dd02c23cffe4f34c901", "ja": "ねえ、刑事さん～。キミ、こんな能力があるなら、\n警察よりいい仕事があったんじゃないの～……？", "zh": "喂，刑警先生～。你要是有这种能力，应该有比当警察更好的工作吧～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "74999cf8cf0eec2a1e5f6d823d8831713b41d188470904fe5b1c1dfcb0ab9d66", "ja": "俺の人生を俺がどうしようと、\nお前には関係ないだろ。", "zh": "我的人生要怎么过是我自己的事，跟你没关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "96d8796290caa1bd3ec34900a42f8d29b16cd592eae0dd894d99e7d76adef1ef", "ja": "前から貴方には光るものがあると思っていました。\nどうですか、私と手を組みませんか？", "zh": "我一直觉得你身上有着闪光点。要不要和我联手？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "cd1d00bccfca95b79d3c394cb44c033c8ef5bf3bb072d3d73742a68c7755c217", "ja": "気を付けろよ、刑事。\nこいつはお前を利用して、最後には殺す気だ。", "zh": "小心点，刑警。这家伙打算利用你，最后还要杀了你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "9ab7c2fc9a44104db906733b4a1cac5cbb90212f1515e4ead3dde41c2a0e21bb", "ja": "マフィアの言葉なんて、信じるに値しませんよ。\n私と貴方の力があればきっと救世への道が……。", "zh": "黑手党的话，不值得相信。  \n只要有我和您的力量，一定能找到通往救世之路的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "490cc0a715327bac50befd23289e272c7d4173f63329096df41252988c2f74c6", "ja": "いいから、お前らこっちに集中しろ！　……ここに\n書かれている名前は、全てお前達とも関係あるはずだ。", "zh": "行了，你们几个专心看这边！……这上面\n写着的名字，应该全都跟你们有关才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "67feacb6c7a2dae21d6c48a4b6e66199aae442c069b11b2b32398abdb70ea899", "ja": "僕はあんまり関係ないけどね～？　あるとすれば、\n僕の『被害者』が関係してるってくらい～？　フフッ。", "zh": "我和这事没什么关系啦～？要说有关系，也就是我的“受害者”和这事有关而已～？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "def8794e3eafe38a5f800e02598fbd52a32562e05c251c695b2c8795d4beff6a", "ja": "新興宗教団体が政府の要人と繋がっているなんて、\n一番怪しいだろ。票の買収か違法な政治献金か……。", "zh": "新兴宗教团体竟然和政府要人有联系，这才是最可疑的吧。是收买选票，还是非法政治献金……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "7c0b44e0b316267bf419db75cf28af3438ea90357342861693cd000c1887c25b", "ja": "貴方達マフィアこそ、この短期間での組織拡大……\n悪事に手を出したと見るのが、妥当では？", "zh": "反倒是你们这些黑手党，在这么短的时间里就扩大了组织规模……认为你们是做了什么坏事，不是更合理吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "1ffcf01b3bd2e021607709cdc46cd359c731ea6dbaead2d3f90a054d5b33b509", "ja": "なんだと？", "zh": "你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "d2af3de6934b6943c9bf5c0ef9e4c8dfca81b7c3167bd69e6069ab79984285c8", "ja": "やりますか？", "zh": "想打架吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "1f0470f3492d965ad86ed6ecf7123174e21fc0734b2e7258be2bce8aa98db85a", "ja": "いきなり仲間割れをするな！　いいか、\nこの仕事には、俺達の釈放が掛かってるんだぞ。", "zh": "别一上来就搞内讧！听好了，\n这份差事可关系到我们能不能被释放啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "30ec0e3b2c69b28bb512cf23563cb9affbe35966539014ad96f2bba31bb19061", "ja": "これが捜査なら、金の流れと人の流れを\n丁寧に追うのが定石なんだが……。", "zh": "如果这是调查的话，仔细追查资金流向和人员动向是常规做法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "c7844cd909dfbdcdd3f1538d1fc675bf5b937a9de031c3aa38315577e43be5f8", "ja": "僕達、持っている情報源も得意分野も違うしね～。\nなら、別行動でいいんじゃないの～……？", "zh": "我们掌握的信息来源和擅长的领域都不一样嘛～。\n那就分头行动吧～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "9e17bc85090761dc0e52e3bb9b2c102bf9cd854acd7b5a7acabde031b6e1bb82", "ja": "この枷がある以上、逃げられもしないしさ～。\nそれでどう？　リーダー……。", "zh": "既然有这个枷锁，也没法逃跑嘛～。这样怎么样，队长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d7522f57816f8a6bca7bfb873d2e2b7f8befdfd5bd28aed3fc988025689d0f6", "ja": "同感です。大人数でぞろぞろ連れ歩くと、\n目立ちますし。やりにくいこともありますからね。", "zh": "我也同意。要是这么多人成群结队地走在一起，\n不仅显眼，而且有些事情也不方便展开行动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "50b847955924f871b580124eda039b0bc4893fa053d5528eebc8d0d87759d5cc", "ja": "ならこっちも、心当たりを探っておくか。\n各々情報を集めてから、再度ここに集合だな。", "zh": "那我们这边也去找找有没有头绪吧。各自收集情报后，再到这里集合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "58b3d1a4c11adb1a5dcc2352d1c7e310b18be6a56c14c3c8829d8eaf09a028f6", "ja": "お、おい！　……くそっ、リーダーとかいって、\n俺の言う事なんて何ひとつ聞きやしないじゃないか！", "zh": "喂、喂！……可恶，嘴上说什么领队，结果根本一句我的话都不听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "10270b3287c3ec380b82784210cd3a8b6716b6a8adb531df40855bc270fad249", "ja": "……まあ、一人の方が気楽なのは同感だ。\n俺は俺のやり方で、探らせてもらうさ。", "zh": "……不过，我也同意一个人更轻松。\n我会用我的方式去调查的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "24e11bb7540d611377032a1ed74af697a59c2f406b45f321fc7231654b11437a", "ja": "（街を探ってみると、確かにイーサンが逮捕されて\nいたにも関わらず、ナターリ一家の動きが活発だった）", "zh": "（我在街上调查了一番，发现尽管伊桑确实已经被捕，纳塔利家族的活动却依然十分活跃）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "3a3a46ea3c6393d7c4076165d0a87ecea071adc90bbbe9cd9ac1c7ae2e3f1d99", "ja": "（今の俺が、情報屋と接触する訳にはいかない。\nなら、直接イーサンを追うのが手っ取り早いはず……）", "zh": "（现在的我不能去和情报贩子接触。既然如此，直接追查伊桑应该是最快的办法……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "f036a1ffd2bfc9d384eb551b17c79cc0100f0a0ae8738a4b315e2d509592eb43", "ja": "あいつ、自分のアジトへと帰らないのか……？\nさっきから、ずっとこの辺りにいるが……。", "zh": "那家伙不回自己的据点吗……？\n从刚才开始，就一直待在这附近……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1031_mafia", "source_sha256": "6cba06f545d065ed5990de8180419a56ab2ea9cca2e67fc2dd6bc422808738db", "ja": "ボ……あ、いや。\n……ゆ、夢？　夢じゃないんですよね！？", "zh": "我……啊，不，没什么。\n……这、这是梦？不是梦吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "396fbb7c5f1469d7f27c204f097011815a14b610f21f4bc414766aa91706d640", "ja": "ああ、本物だ。お前はうまくやっているか、\nジョー。ファミリーのみんなと。", "zh": "啊，是真的。你过得还好吗，乔？\n和家族的大家相处得还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1033_joe", "source_sha256": "7943e92430287f3800b751f6dd4be5cb9cd9d5a8c41ed4ac34cf8ae4d03c3684", "ja": "は、はいっ！　本当に、脱獄してくるなんて……\n流石、俺達の『帝王イーサン』だ！！", "zh": "啊、是！居然真的越狱出来了……不愧是我们那位『帝王伊桑』！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1034_joe", "source_sha256": "83440a126f08dc517d7c607d325e34d7d290ad0d9b4bc0b7617ac22d2a901578", "ja": "合図をもらって、すぐに\nアジトを飛び出してきたんです！", "zh": "一收到暗号，我就马上\n从秘密基地里飞奔出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "724a882a433938a1004c115a6b4a5c9fd4dffc062dcccde3eb3c6395356c2b0f", "ja": "相変わらず騒がしい奴だ。\n……ちょうどいい、少し付き合え。", "zh": "还是一如既往地吵闹啊。\n……正好，陪我一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1036_joe", "source_sha256": "172684d270b2ea30ab076595ef665b00054e89f2296fbdb78f5944c6a52d9dbe", "ja": "は、はい！\nもちろんです！", "zh": "好、好的！\n当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1037_joe", "source_sha256": "5a907f93cac4d19bb2aeb3e74f0d071dd73cdf22d1d0b162aec3cbe17b94935f", "ja": "あれから、大変だったんですよ！\n他のファミリーに狙われながら、シマを守って……。", "zh": "从那以后，可真是够呛的！\n一边被其他家族盯上，一边还得守住地盘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1038_joe", "source_sha256": "e0793bf5b21b9b4d16a2b8ad9ae50fe063596990edea4daf50d30ac6cbbb61e8", "ja": "でも、見てください！　今までのシマだけじゃない。\n今となってはこの大通りも、俺達のシマですから！", "zh": "但是，请看！已经不只是原来的地盘了。\n如今这条大街也是我们的地盘！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "daffd6b805d2aec80b109fb0184a185ed2b952e6907fac0cd714728060fdf0df", "ja": "そうか。……ところでお前、約束どおり、\nここに来る事は誰にも言わなかっただろうな？", "zh": "这样啊。……不过，你这家伙应该遵守约定，没把要来这里的事告诉任何人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1040_joe", "source_sha256": "e1b9be5ca339fc8239f12999ed264853d7d6293ec91cdb5ca9bc9e8e03f45a90", "ja": "も、もちろんです！", "zh": "当、当然了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "77f25ad312c16b0fd1238ae3a6a5d983bf4d8c64dbcbea7789347a3e4f0fe430", "ja": "なら、お前のアダ名……ビッグマウス（おしゃべり）も\n改めないといけないな。", "zh": "那，你的外号……“大嘴巴”（爱聊天）也得改改了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1042_joe", "source_sha256": "5ab0c92fbd8591050086ce9e48feb17607937541a3083dd785f178b3dca34f80", "ja": "そ、そうですよ！\nそんな、誰にでも話すなんて事は……絶対……。", "zh": "对、对啊！这种事……我绝对不会告诉任何人的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1043_003mik", "source_sha256": "ca47e459726129366424677c1a7253a9ef01d245f8386aa719e580d7e1197f94", "ja": "（なんだ……？　人気がない方に入って行ったが……。\nこの位置だと、上からの見通しがいい。これは……）", "zh": "（怎么回事……？他往没什么人的地方走去了……。\n从这个位置看，上面的视野很好。这是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1044_joe", "source_sha256": "a7cc03cf41106098e388dc027d2bb5b14267fe59a5488d27028b3b33215850cf", "ja": "それにしても、また『帝王イーサン』と一緒に\nシマを歩ける日が来るなんて……ホント、感動です！", "zh": "话说回来，没想到竟然还有能再次和“帝王伊森”一起在地盘上走走的一天……真的太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "a02af2427a78556b81fed90563d452e08b26281632d15568f44666dd9c473881", "ja": "あの頃、お前は僕にベッタリだったからな。\n酷いおしゃべりで、特に多かった口癖は……。", "zh": "那时候你总是黏着我呢。\n话特别多，最常挂在嘴边的一句话是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1046_joe", "source_sha256": "4abf6a3070d935853815b442baf283d0b4d536b9de7ca1b2680498cba13a9010", "ja": "お、お説教はもう勘弁ですよ！\n俺だって、今は……！", "zh": "说、说教就饶了我吧！\n我现在也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1047_030iku", "source_sha256": "0181891024bd96fb4950942ae64c303b3233b4f6ce54edfd5a82332d8df394d2", "ja": "今は、なんだ？", "zh": "现在是，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1048_030iku", "source_sha256": "30d4f9256cbeff0baa0ebd94531f151a0a62413c4079b0df8368bb5af625bedc", "ja": "お前はいつも言っていたな。二言目には『ボス』、と。\nああ。そういえば、今日は一度も呼んでいないな？", "zh": "你以前总是这么说来着。每说两句就要喊一声“老大”。\n\n啊，这么一说，今天确实一次都没叫过呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1049_joe", "source_sha256": "5ec1d7b8d3ff8c1fa4ce2feab27a94b4fe8360b81583bc21816d1d53208d1f84", "ja": "……。\nな、何を言って……。", "zh": "……。\n你、你在说什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1050_030iku", "source_sha256": "201c128c328b88606468b875547a83ea9ca67a6da1e995857c18f26d7f6c19b5", "ja": "小心者で、度胸がない。だから、準備をする\n時間をくれてやったんだが……もういいのか？", "zh": "胆小又没魄力。所以我才特意给了你准备的\n时间……但你已经准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1051_030iku", "source_sha256": "b9e3f498ffe6256e115993b07d9e930713530947e7fb576ae061e0bdaadc9a70", "ja": "わからないなら、言ってやろう。\n──『僕を殺せる準備は整ったのか、新しいボス』？", "zh": "不明白的话，我就说给你听吧。\n──“杀掉我的准备已经做好了吗，新首领”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1052_joe", "source_sha256": "9ed62d0cd0ff4544473c3b6292226e19e8e0cfe6b994164a8692b6086615a883", "ja": "！！\nや、やれっ！", "zh": "！！\n动、动手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_03_1053_003mik", "source_sha256": "a32cbf6854ffbb1b958074551850f2d58fdfe18a4b0f4a6ca71faa88cc2418a5", "ja": "！？　……危ない！", "zh": "！？……危险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
